        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Britney Spears, Leonard, Selena Gomez, Madonna, Patrick Leonard\n- Songs: \"Rock Me In\", \"Whiplash\", the other song, Madonna song inspired by San Pedro Town\n- Topics: Latin pop influence, songwriting, co-writing, co-production\n\nFacts:\n- Britney Spears and Leonard wrote the songs \"Rock Me In\" and \"Whiplash.\"\n- \"Whiplash\" was recorded by Selena Gomez & the Scene.\n- Britney Spears and Leonard also wrote one other song.\n- That other song has a Latin pop influence.\n- The Latin pop influence was compared to a Madonna song that was said to be inspired by San Pedro Town.\n- Madonna co-wrote and co-produced that comparison song with Patrick Leonard.",
